#: crates/leyline-studio/ui/dialogs/rename.slint:24
msgctxt "RenameDialog"
msgid "Template — {{name}} {{date}} {{time}} {{seq}}. The extension is kept."
msgstr "Gabarit — {{name}} {{date}} {{time}} {{seq}}. L'extension est conservée."

#. counterpart of ADR 0100's refusal to offer an undo.
#: crates/leyline-studio/ui/dialogs/rename.slint:49
msgctxt "RenameDialog"
msgid ""
"This renames the files themselves. A name already taken is refused, never "
"overwritten, and RAW+JPEG pairs are renamed together."
msgstr "Ceci renomme les fichiers eux-mêmes. Un nom déjà pris est refusé, jamais écrasé, et les paires RAW+JPEG sont renommées ensemble."

