#: crates/leyline-studio/ui/types.slint:563
msgctxt "Tr"
msgid ""
"The photos leave the catalog, and their files — with their XMP sidecars — "
"are sent to the system trash, from where they can still be recovered."
msgstr "Les photos quittent le catalogue, et leurs fichiers — avec leurs sidecars XMP — partent à la corbeille du système, d'où ils restent récupérables."

#: crates/leyline-studio/ui/types.slint:566
